WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
RailWeave 2.2 joins spatial prototypes and delivery evidence to coordinate innovation, renewal and public service.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
One axis, three corridors and three hubs connect demand, validation and conversion.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Zhongzhiyuan prioritises controlled, independent and reproducible testing.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000
AI Origin starts from a shared ground floor for participation, real demand and PoC.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Dazhongsi links station-city public space, lawful procurement and 90/180-day review.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.000
All three AI prototypes retain human decisions, non-digital channels and stop conditions.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Seven gates place site, responsibility, procurement, operations and exit in one register.

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.000
The proposal is conceptual and does not replace statutory planning, professional review or investment decisions.
